Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1050-1051] Onigashima 48 - Kozuki Momonosuke.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:30.04,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew\NSubtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.61,0:01:58.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1736,766)}Big\NMom's\Nhole
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:21.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Battle on the rooftop of the Skull Dome, Onigashima,\Nin the skies above the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.05,0:02:24.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The victor: Kaido.\NOr, so he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.39,0:02:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.65,0:02:34.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.66,0:02:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All of you were incredible!\NTruly unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:53.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am so overjoyed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.38,0:03:04.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Been ages since I seen 'em, meow!\NThem's those sky boat lanterns, ain't?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:05.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oopsie...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:09.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't no lie, yous gara!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.93,0:03:13.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, by his own strength,\Nsent Kaido plummetin' into the bowels of the earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.36,0:03:21.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And, Momonosuke-sama turned inta a giant dragon\Nn' stopped Onigashima's descent!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.82,0:03:23.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did I get all that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:24.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.28,0:03:30.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're saying that pink dragon\Nwas Momonosuke-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:32.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a Devil Fruit user?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:36.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's been twenty years\Nsince that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.34,0:03:45.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since Oden-sama's tragic death,\Nsince the start of our war t' avenge 'im...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.35,0:03:51.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An' now, we've finally won!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.35,0:03:57.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We took down two\NEmperors of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:04:01.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I didn't think I'd make it out alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.90,0:04:04.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Purrrrmeow mrowmeow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.70,0:04:13.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meeeow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feels great, hunting the big game, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:50.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I ain't happy about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.42,0:04:57.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.38,0:04:58.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.71,0:04:59.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cap...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.34,0:05:00.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cap...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cap...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.63,0:05:03.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.84,0:05:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.09,0:05:09.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey...\NNo clinging!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.18,0:05:14.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat took down Kaido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He did it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.56,0:05:20.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy won!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.48,0:05:25.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya did it, Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.95,0:05:28.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yippee! Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:29.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy won!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:31.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.17,0:05:46.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Everybody around me, going off\Nand pushing themselves to their limits...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:49.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Two seriously injured\Npeople, incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.26,0:05:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Zoro isn't waking up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.89,0:05:56.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dr. Chopper! Please come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:05:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:06:00.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dr. Chopper!\NWe need you here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:03.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dr. Chopper!\NThe wound reopened!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.90,0:06:04.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.44,0:06:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dr. Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.74,0:06:06.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:10.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Miyagi!\NThere's too many critical patients!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.74,0:06:13.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay! Let's take care of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.99,0:06:18.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We scoured the castle\Nfor medicine and medical equipment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.04,0:06:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, in the capital,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:29.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the lively festival is coming to a close...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.85,0:06:37.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Steady as she gooooes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.98,0:06:45.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, Tengu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:49.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it, O-Toko?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:54.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard my dad was\Na super important guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.20,0:07:00.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And he knew he'd\Nget killed if he got caught!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.75,0:07:06.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But somebody said he went in\Ngot himself caught on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:08.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder why...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:11.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is because...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.10,0:07:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yasuie-dono gave\Nthis country a fighting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.69,0:07:25.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Had he not done...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:32.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...what he did that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:39.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,all the lanterns of hope we had lit to that point\Nwould have been extinguished.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.08,0:07:43.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cover your children's eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:46.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The last Daimyo to serve under Kozuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:50.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, no... Ebisu Town's\Nhappy-go-lucky guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.72,0:07:53.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Will be crossing over to the other side!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:07.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He sacrificed his life for the sake of\Nprotecting the future of the Land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:13.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So that you may live happily in the future\Nhe and the others have guaranteed
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He did it for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:17.99,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(828,398)}Daddy,\NI miss\Nyou
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.50,0:08:30.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toko! Toko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.01,0:08:32.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toko!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.14,0:08:38.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...you ate the fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:41.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I toldja not to eat that...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:49.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.24,0:08:54.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toko...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:05.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mind if Daddy has some?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:06.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:10.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're quite a dancer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:13.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll be the best dancer\Nin all of Wano someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:14.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya think so?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.56,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(829,396)}Daddy,\NI miss\Nyou
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:26.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.35,0:09:30.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For me? To live happily?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:32.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis what I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:34.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then I'mma...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.11,0:09:35.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...change my message!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This look good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:48.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.96,0:09:52.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis much better...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.17,0:09:54.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.92,0:09:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.18,0:10:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...no higher honor for a samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:14.61,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(877,423)}Daddy,\N{\s1}I miss\Nyou{\s0}\Nthank\Nyou
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.07,0:10:24.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Steady as she gooooes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.84,0:10:34.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zunesha...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:39.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zunesha, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.22,0:10:42.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have given much thought to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.93,0:10:45.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will not...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.06,0:10:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...open our borders, yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:51.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.81,0:10:55.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I defer to your decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.36,0:10:57.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have no reason to distrust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:11:00.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mmm. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.62,0:11:09.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't celebrate yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:12.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We still outnumber you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.46,0:11:14.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You snooze, you lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:15.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.88,0:11:20.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way Kaido-san could lose!\NWe're an Emperor of the Sea's crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:24.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn, they don't know when to give up...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.35,0:11:26.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna go, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.64,0:11:30.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I still got plenty left in the tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.18,0:11:31.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, Franky-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.85,0:11:34.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaddap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:36.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop this at once,\NAnimal Kingdom Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.57,0:11:41.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You still do not understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:43.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your lives were forfeit!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:46.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Young Master Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:52.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The one who stopped Onigashima from falling\Nafter Kaido's Flame Clouds had vanished...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.04,0:11:53.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...was our very own...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:56.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...commander-in-chief\NKozuki Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:11:58.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whose side was he on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:01.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have lost the battle\Nand your lives were spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:04.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But if you press your attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:08.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will cleanse this world\Nof you thoroughly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.94,0:12:15.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is this tremor?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:22.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it? An earthquake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:42.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:44.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babanuki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.09,0:12:45.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.38,0:12:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Something's wrong\Non the sea surface!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.51,0:12:48.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.60,0:12:49.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.52,0:12:54.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:57.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The lot of you! Don't just stand there!\NGo check on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.88,0:13:25.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:29.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An undersea volcano erupted?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:34.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Battle in the Skies\Nover the Land of Wano...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.93,0:13:37.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Former Victor: Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:39.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The New Victor:\NStraw Hat Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.74,0:13:48.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An eruption?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.70,0:13:50.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's coming from Udon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.37,0:13:52.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What was that jolt?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:54.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are Kaido and his ilk\Nup to something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.12,0:13:58.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something's flying this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:03.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No need to worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:05.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is not a crisis!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.26,0:14:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Kaido... sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.14,0:14:14.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why is he here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.60,0:14:17.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Today is supposed to be\Nour one free day!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:22.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My loyal subjects!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:24.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am not Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.48,0:14:26.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.57,0:14:28.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The war is over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.03,0:14:30.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That eruption was...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:32.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the final beat of the drum, signaling...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.95,0:14:36.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the end of Kaido, Supreme Commander of the Animal Kingdom Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:47.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where did the dragon go?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:50.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.81,0:14:56.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's people...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:15:00.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:23.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuh!\NKomurasaki-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:27.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That can't be! Is she a ghost?!\NWe just held her funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.21,0:15:30.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Is this for real?\NOr am I just dreaming?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.30,0:15:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She is real! Real beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:38.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss Kyoshiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.22,0:15:41.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to your\Nspecial pompadour?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.73,0:15:45.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.19,0:15:48.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis a long tale...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:51.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we present to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.82,0:15:54.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the new Shogun\Nof the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:58.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is it possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:01.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.71,0:16:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No... It's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.92,0:16:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:14.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is no need to flee...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.76,0:16:17.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That dragon...\NI do not believe it was Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:19.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does that mean... a second dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:24.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss Kyoshiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.85,0:16:27.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.31,0:16:29.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can she be here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.36,0:16:34.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is happening at\Nthe front of the palace?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.07,0:16:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please explain, Boss Kyoshiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:39.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naturally, the two of you\Nare quite famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.49,0:16:45.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I wonder, does anybody still recall us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:56.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-K-Kin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.98,0:17:06.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,K-Kin'emon-dono!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.23,0:17:08.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Foxfire Kin'emon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:10.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How?! Was he not long dead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:14.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did he not perish\Nin the flames of the Oden Castle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.03,0:17:17.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is he doing here?!\NIs this truly all a mere dream?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:23.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have we crossed into\Nthe Land of the Dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:26.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But when did we die?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.62,0:17:29.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No! Who cares if it's a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.54,0:17:33.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anybody else feel like\Nsomething monumental is about to occur?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.09,0:17:35.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yokozuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.55,0:17:42.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu-sama, the Kappa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:47.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Inuarashi-dono!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.81,0:17:52.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even Raizo of the Mist?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.86,0:17:55.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nekomamushi-dono, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.28,0:17:56.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:59.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kikunojo-sama of the Fallen Snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:03.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boss Kyoshiro, what is the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.83,0:18:08.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Napping Kyoshiro" was naught but an alias I assumed\Nto evade the prying eyes of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.67,0:18:11.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In actuality, I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.38,0:18:14.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Denjiro of the Nine Red Scabbards!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:22.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Nine Red Scabbards!\NIt really is them, in the flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.47,0:18:23.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They still lived!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.85,0:18:25.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Red Scabbards have returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did they not all perish twenty years ago?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.27,0:18:37.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Toki-sama spoke the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:55.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is unfathomable!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.00,0:18:57.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody! Prepare a Light Scroll!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.88,0:19:01.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Make haste!\NAll of Wano must know this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.64,0:19:05.14,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1605,623)}Kuri
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.89,0:19:03.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A transmission from the capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.76,0:19:05.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One and all, to Bakura Town!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:09.64,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(293,410)}Ringo
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.52,0:19:10.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,News from the capital!\NWhat could have happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:12.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is this about the earthquake just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.64,0:19:12.65,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(225,295)}Hakumai
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:14.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was afraid the whole village\Nwould collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:15.15,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1633,278)}Kibi
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.15,0:19:18.65,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(274,332)}Udon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.45,0:19:22.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! We've got bigger worries\Nthan some broadcast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:25.16,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1681,350)}Ebisu\NTown
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.87,0:19:27.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? What? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:31.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.96,0:19:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Communications\Nfrom the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.50,0:19:36.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Project the Light Scroll!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.09,0:19:44.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido's sons!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.51,0:19:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes! Pleased to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.18,0:19:49.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna fight?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:52.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-D-Don't struggle!\NYou waste your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.15,0:19:57.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does that mean...\NOur battle is still not won?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:20:01.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nay, most certainly not!\NI am not your foe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.07,0:20:04.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have followed your exploits\Nin the news for so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.82,0:20:08.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I admit, there were many of you\Nwhom I doubted were even human.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.20,0:20:10.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But now that I see you\Nin the flesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.45,0:20:11.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, what about your horns?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:17.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you say Kaido's son?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.00,0:20:20.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami-swannn! Your savior is coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.71,0:20:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate, I will be joining you\Non your vessel!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:27.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am Kozuki Oden, also known as Yamato!\NIt is an honor to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:31.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.06,0:20:33.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Joining you on your vessel"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.02,0:20:37.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm all for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:40.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm especially for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:42.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a funny boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.78,0:20:48.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid that decision falls on the captain.\NWe cannot accept you unless he says yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:49.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.54,0:21:00.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I only hope that Luffy\Nwill make it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.47,0:21:09.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I got shivers watching his fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.30,0:21:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Witnessing his glorious visage!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.93,0:21:15.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It was like, whack, bam, ka-boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.14,0:21:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, it was breathtaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.73,0:21:22.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's split!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.65,0:21:24.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it ain't safe here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.44,0:21:28.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They'll pay us back, an eye for an eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.66,0:21:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:39.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who, exactly, gave you\Npermission to leave?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:41.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't wanna be slaves,\NYoung Master Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.80,0:21:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Halt, lest I pummel you into the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.63,0:21:47.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Flight?!\NThat is a disgraceful act for a soldier!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.01,0:21:49.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut yer traps and stay here, grunts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.59,0:21:51.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or face my wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:51.81,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(963,91)}Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.56,0:21:54.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He doesn't seem like an enemy,\Nthat's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:57.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say, what happens with those guys now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:22:01.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My technique'll wear off once\Nthe moon comes back round.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.65,0:22:03.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You mean, in a month?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.53,0:22:04.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.61,0:22:09.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After a month, some o' the animals\Ngo back to how they was before,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.70,0:22:13.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but some of 'em stay friends with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.04,0:22:14.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.41,0:22:16.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose it depends\Non their personality?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.37,0:22:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I bet they choose whichever\Nfeels better to 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.92,0:22:22.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.46,0:22:24.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.51,0:22:29.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so much happier with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.05,0:22:30.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Horselina-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:34.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope ya stay with me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:38.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I dun want a servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.94,0:22:43.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want ya to stay with me\Nan' be my mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.44,0:22:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Horselina-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.99,0:22:58.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Master... Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.37,0:23:03.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.13,0:23:07.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Horselina-chan!\NYou're holding me a lil too tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.01,0:23:13.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama and Horselina...\NI'm happy for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.39,0:23:14.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.61,0:23:28.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,L-Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.57,0:23:31.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki, Kin-san, and all the rest\Nare on their knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.00,0:23:42.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.43,0:23:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Twenty years have passed...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.97,0:23:57.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,since the passing of my father,\NKozuki Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.22,0:24:00.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.02,0:24:04.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though these years have\Nsurely worn on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.31,0:24:06.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you have done well to persevere!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.23,0:24:08.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Fire Festival shall not end!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.23,0:24:12.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Starting tomorrow,\Nyou may do whatever business you please!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.32,0:24:14.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! But Orochi will...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.61,0:24:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can drink all you want, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:17.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.87,0:24:19.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No longer shall you be charged\Nfor well water!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.50,0:24:24.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No longer shall the factories\Nrelease toxins that parch the soil!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.04,0:24:27.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Land of Wano is no place for slavery!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.71,0:24:31.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momo... kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.92,0:24:35.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You need not suffer any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.94,0:24:49.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Four more died at the factory today...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.02,0:24:50.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe that will be me tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.00,0:25:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna break it to O-Tama-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.01,0:25:15.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Tama-chan, I hate to tell you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.63,0:25:18.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...your father and mother are...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.86,0:25:33.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daddy... Mommy...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.40,0:25:36.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.53,0:25:38.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.95,0:25:44.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.08,0:25:49.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Woven hats for sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.46,0:25:52.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does anybody need a hat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.17,0:25:55.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They's sturdy and'll last ya for ages!\NIt's a real steal!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.17,0:25:57.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D'ya want a hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.93,0:26:00.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I don't have money.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.31,0:26:04.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hats for sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.56,0:26:06.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anybody want a hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.28,0:26:18.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komachiyo, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.28,0:26:21.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Couldn't sell a single hat...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.51,0:26:42.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,May I have a hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.56,0:26:48.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,T-Tengu-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.15,0:26:55.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're an orphan?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.44,0:26:58.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.91,0:27:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just a few years more...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.49,0:27:06.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The mighty samurai, the Kozuki,\Nshall return to our land,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:10.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and when that day comes,\Nthey shall vanquish the ogres once and for all!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.54,0:27:13.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.34,0:27:15.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.38,0:27:23.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll keep goin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.68,0:27:31.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the Kozuki'll\Nkick those ogres' butts!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.98,0:27:36.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I ain't gonna give up!\NI'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.99,0:27:42.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Tama...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.95,0:27:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.66,0:27:50.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.25,0:27:53.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll make it so this is normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.33,0:27:56.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By the time we're outta this country,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.29,0:28:00.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,it'll be a place where\Nyou can eat all ya want!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.40,0:28:15.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The wicked rule of Orochi...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.15,0:28:18.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and the days spent cowering in fear of Kaido\Nhave now come to an end!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.62,0:28:30.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I crossed the ocean and met\Nstrong, faithful compatriots!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.54,0:28:36.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alongside the Ninja Pirate Mink Samurai Alliance,\NI led a raid upon Onigashima!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.29,0:28:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido, Orochi, and the\NAnimal Kingdom Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.92,0:28:42.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Every evil that plagues our fair land...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.22,0:28:47.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...has been vanquished!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.26,0:28:50.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaaat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.81,0:28:53.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-You slew those monsters?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.94,0:28:56.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That awful Orochi is gone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.61,0:28:59.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The what alliance...!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.32,0:29:07.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't need to be afraid anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.28,0:29:08.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.03,0:29:10.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fresh water to drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.24,0:29:13.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't have to live through\Nthat hell anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.79,0:29:16.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finally... Finally...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.50,0:29:25.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we will never forget all the brave souls\Nwhose sacrifices paved the way for our raid!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.75,0:29:56.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'emon, what do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.54,0:29:58.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know not what else to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.96,0:30:03.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just show off a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.09,0:30:07.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you just a puppet, Momo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.43,0:30:10.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There anything left in the world\Nfor ya to be scared of?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.14,0:30:17.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The name my father bestowed upon me...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.48,0:30:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...means "one without peer."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.73,0:30:26.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Under my rule, even our parched, desolate land\Nshall surely turn to a paradise!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.57,0:30:29.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ask that you join me\Nin making that promise a reality!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.62,0:30:32.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Having crossed twenty years,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.74,0:30:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I have arrived to save you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.62,0:30:39.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As of this day...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.38,0:30:45.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I, Kozuki Momonosuke,\Nshall lead the Land of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.77,0:31:06.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.75,0:31:26.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.55,0:31:29.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall remain true to my word!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.09,0:31:33.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.22,0:31:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall follow in your footsteps!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.99,0:31:51.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.00,0:32:07.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The true shogunate has returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.71,0:32:10.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We've waited for so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.97,0:32:13.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.76,0:32:21.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As a proud warrior sheathes his blade,\Ncherry blossom petals flutter...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.73,0:32:24.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...into the skies of that promised day.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.85,0:32:27.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the proud Land of Samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.32,0:32:31.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here under the night blossoms stands\Na handsome man of eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.99,0:32:35.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blessed with great\Ndedication and mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.49,0:32:38.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,albeit with strength that\Nleaves a little something to be desired.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.71,0:32:49.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the birth of the man who\Nwould later be known around the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.76,0:32:55.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...as the Great Shogun of Wano,\NKozuki Momonosuke!
